- Compiled frontend fixtures are from the corresponding official Windows packages.

These fixtures retain the original unpatched model-catalog behavior for offline
before/after regressions. Only selected functions are evaluated with synthetic
authentication, storage and transport dependencies. They are not shipped in the
application and must not be executed as a real client. Expected original digests
are recorded in resources/crew-model-repair/manifest.json.
